<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Dec 11.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Dec 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Suffolk/Essex Dec 96.00/97.00/97.50 Jan 97.00</p>
<p>Jan/Mar 99.00/98.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Dec 94.50/95.00 Jan 97.00 Oct/Dec 97.50</p>
<p>Gloucester Jan 95.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jan/Mar 98.50/9.00</p>
<p>Avon Dec 95.50 Jan/Mar 98.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Dec 97.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Dec 97.00 Jan 99.00 Jan/Mar</p>
<p>99.00</p>
<p>Southampton Dec 97.00</p>
<p>No milling wheat business was reported.</p>
</text>
